<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1347227968"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1701095264"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Bloom"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Dabin / Dia Frampton"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Wild Youth"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:00.000"><div begin="00:04.370" end="03:51.777"><p begin="00:04.370" end="00:07.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Will we always stay this way?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在哪 我们总是这样</span></p><p begin="00:08.103" end="00:11.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Wrapped up in the summer days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉浸在夏日的困倦中</span></p><p begin="00:11.217" end="00:13.889" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Try to find that piece of time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要找回那段回忆</span></p><p begin="00:13.889" end="00:17.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">That lets me freeze you in my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你定格在我的脑海中</span></p><p begin="00:17.533" end="00:21.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I don't want us to change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望我们一如当初 不想一点点失去自我</span></p><p begin="00:21.120" end="00:23.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Don't want us to chip away</p><p begin="00:23.899" end="00:28.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Oh, I am tryin' to save<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我努力自救 不想随大流</span></p><p begin="00:28.300" end="00:31.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Our bodies against the waves</p><p begin="00:31.322" end="00:34.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Could we stay in bloom?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="00:38.389" end="00:43.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Everything is new<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都是那么新奇</span></p><p begin="00:45.587" end="00:47.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I don't want to leave this room<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想离开这个房间 让我留下吧</span></p><p begin="00:47.808" end="00:52.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Just let me stay, let me stay with you</p><p begin="00:52.613" end="00:57.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Could we stay in bloom?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="00:58.586" end="01:01.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能呆在这吗？</span></p><p begin="01:06.648" end="01:09.066" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="01:13.699" end="01:16.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="01:20.844" end="01:23.028" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="01:30.382" end="01:33.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Holdin' tight to what we have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好好珍惜我们所拥有的</span></p><p begin="01:33.967" end="01:36.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">If it's lost, will it come back?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失去的一切 还能找回来吗</span></p><p begin="01:37.532" end="01:40.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Tell me if this windin' road<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 这条崎岖之路上</span></p><p begin="01:40.010" end="01:43.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Is made of dirt or made of gold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是充满坎坷还是荣耀无限</span></p><p begin="01:43.740" end="01:46.975" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">I don't want us to change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望我们一如当初 不想一点点失去自我</span></p><p begin="01:46.975" end="01:49.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Don't want us to chip away</p><p begin="01:50.017" end="01:54.062" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Oh, I am tryin' to save<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我努力自救 不想随大流</span></p><p begin="01:54.062" end="01:57.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Our bodies against the waves</p><p begin="01:57.502" end="02:02.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Could we stay in bloom?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="02:04.435" end="02:10.031" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Everything was new<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都是那么新奇</span></p><p begin="02:11.611" end="02:13.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I don't want to leave this room<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想离开这个房间 让我留下吧</span></p><p begin="02:13.852" end="02:18.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Just let me stay, let me stay with you</p><p begin="02:18.739" end="02:24.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Could we stay in bloom?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="02:39.637" end="02:42.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I don't want to leave this room<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想离开这个房间 让我留下吧</span></p><p begin="02:42.437" end="02:46.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Just let me stay, let me stay with you</p><p begin="02:47.296" end="02:52.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Could we stay in bloom?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="02:53.971" end="02:56.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="03:01.162" end="03:03.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="03:08.422" end="03:10.558" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="03:15.510" end="03:17.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="03:29.914" end="03:32.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="03:36.957" end="03:39.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Could we stay in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以吗</span></p><p begin="03:39.117" end="03:40.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">(Could we stay in bloom?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="03:40.131" end="03:41.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">(Could we stay in bloom?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能保持青春吗？</span></p><p begin="03:41.956" end="03:44.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">(Could we stay in bloom?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="03:45.918" end="03:47.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">(Could we stay in bloom?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="03:47.329" end="03:49.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">(Could we stay in bloom?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p><p begin="03:49.136" end="03:51.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">(Could we stay in bloom?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能永远留在青春时代吗</span></p></div></body></tt>